# Files kept out of the published archive.
#
# `.pubignore` REPLACES `.gitignore` for this directory when publishing, so
# everything that must stay out of the package is listed here, not only the
# paths that git also ignores.

# The suite: 108 KB against the 52 KB of `lib/`, downloaded by everyone who
# depends on the package and of no use to any of them. It stays in the
# repository, where it can be read and run.
/test/

# The repository's own process, not the package: the regimen the agents read,
# the state they keep, the mirror scripts, and CI.
/docs/
/AGENTS.md
/CLAUDE.md
/.github/
/.vscode/

# The Russian mirrors of the two public pages. They live beside the originals,
# so that a reader finds one where the other is; pub.dev renders `README.md`
# and `example/README.md` and has no use for either translation.
/README.ru.md
/example/README.ru.md

# Platform folders of the example: `flutter create .` regenerates them, and a
# reader of an example needs its Dart.
/example/macos/

# Flutter/Dart/Pub related
# Libraries should not include pubspec.lock, per
# https://dart.dev/guides/libraries/private-files#pubspeclock.
/pubspec.lock
**/doc/api/
.dart_tool/
build/

# Miscellaneous
*.log
.DS_Store
